[en.FOCUS_C18_011_XUN]
Xun

[en.FOCUS_C18_011_XUN_desc]
Xun, penetrating, gentle like a spring breeze. If we follow the terrain, environment, and celestial designs, it will be three times beneficial as we act at the market.\nThe outside world knows very little about the Kirins, while the Kirin commune is vast and rich in resources. In §Ctrade§!, we will definitely bring more surprises to the world.\nWhether it is the eastern unicorns, ponies, dragons, or even centaurs, we should accept them with an open mind and achieve mutual benefit in the connection and trade, just as things on the ground can rise with the wind and travel with the wind.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_011_XUN]
巽

[zh.FOCUS_C18_011_XUN_desc]
巽，入也，柔和如春风。依地势、环境、天象而行，则为利市三倍。\n外界对麒麟知之甚少，而麒麟社群地大物博，物产丰富。在§C贸易§!中，我们必定能为世界带去更多的惊喜。\n无论是东方独角兽，小马，龙族，甚至是半人马，我们都应该以开放的心态去接纳他们，并在交往与贸易中互惠共赢，正如地上事物均能随风而起，乘风而行。

